@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
participant Game
participant Npcap
participant Sniffer
participant PacketProcessor as Parser
participant UserDataManager as DataMgr
participant Express as API
participant Renderer as UI
Game -> Npcap: TCP/IP packets
Npcap -> Sniffer: captured frames
Sniffer -> Parser: packets
Parser -> DataMgr: update stats
UI -> API: GET /api/data (token)
API -> DataMgr: read stats
API --> UI: JSON { code, user }
@enduml
